    <div class="chapter left reveal"><span class="bignum">04</span><div class="num">Chapter Four</div><div class="orn"><span class="d"></span></div><h2 id="types">The four product types worth starting with</h2></div>
    <p class="answer reveal">The four beginner-friendly digital products that sell reliably are templates, planners and workbooks, short guides, and prompt or resource packs — each is fast to make and solves one clear problem.</p>
    <p class="reveal">You don't need to invent a new category. You need to pick the one that matches what you already know and can make this week.</p>

