    <div class="chapter reveal"><span class="bignum">05</span><div class="num">Chapter Five</div><div class="orn"><span class="d"></span></div><h2 id="make">How to make your first one this week</h2></div>
    <p class="answer reveal">Make your first digital product in a week by choosing one format, one problem, and one afternoon to build it — then a checkout link and a delivery file, and it's live.</p>
    <p class="reveal">The build is smaller than the fear around it. A template is a document. A guide is a well-organised answer to a question you already know. The tools you need — a design tool, a checkout, a delivery page — all have free tiers. <strong>The gap between "no product" and "first product" is one focused afternoon, not one more course.</strong></p>

